一种独立的存在，现在这些片段可以保留下来，我们可以放不止一个，不会觉得

1207
00:51:49.770 --> 00:51:54.110
like, you know, we had the time constraints before and we can only pick one.
像以前那样，你知道，我们有时间限制，只能选一个。

1208
00:51:54.410 --> 00:51:56.870
I love that, especially as supporting caSt.
我喜欢这样，尤其是作为配角。

1209
00:51:56.990 --> 00:52:00.190
I feel like a lot of times our talking heads were cut for time.
我觉得很多时候我们的访谈片段都是因为时间不够被剪掉了。

1210
00:52:00.510 --> 00:52:02.890
So I'm going to look for all of them.
所以我打算把它们全都找出来。

1211
00:52:03.110 --> 00:52:04.570
I just, I'm delighted by that.
我对此感到非常高兴。

1212
00:52:04.570 --> 00:52:09.550
Well, I wonder how many subscriptions to Peacock we just sold in this podcast today.
嗯，我在想今天这期播客我们刚卖出了多少个Peacock订阅。

1213
00:52:09.810 --> 00:52:10.910
I would think a lot.
我觉得应该不少。

1214
00:52:11.170 --> 00:52:13.530
And I would think, Dave, it's all because of you.
而且我觉得，戴夫，这全都是因为你。

1215
00:52:13.650 --> 00:52:18.730
And we wanted to have you on today because you were doing a beautiful thing for the show.
我们今天想请你来，是因为你为这部剧做了一件很棒的事。

1216
00:52:18.910 --> 00:52:21.590
And we're so appreciative as fans of The Office.
作为《办公室》的粉丝，我们非常感激。

1217
00:52:21.770 --> 00:52:22.570
We're both fans.
我们俩都是粉丝。

1218
00:52:22.850 --> 00:52:24.710
And we, this is not a sponsored episode.
而且，这不是赞助节目。

1219
00:52:24.790 --> 00:52:26.370
We don't get anything for this.
我们从中得不到任何好处。

1220
00:52:26.490 --> 00:52:29.950
I mean, we don't get money for the episodes that air on Peacock.
我是说，在Peacock上播出的剧集我们拿不到钱。

1221
00:52:30.310 --> 00:52:33.410
But what you have done here is a gift.
但你在这里所做的一切是一份礼物。

1222
00:52:33.410 --> 00:52:34.650
It is a gift to fans.
这是给粉丝的一份礼物。

1223
00:52:34.830 --> 00:52:35.830
It is a beautiful thing.
这是一件美好的事情。

1224
00:52:36.890 --> 00:52:42.270
And it's just, we're so excited that we get to talk about it and highlight it for that reason.
我们非常兴奋能谈论它，并以此为由重点介绍它。

1225
00:52:42.750 --> 00:52:43.170
Thank you.
谢谢。

1226
00:52:43.290 --> 00:52:44.870
I'm excited for you guys to watch them.
我很期待你们去观看它们。

1227
00:52:45.130 --> 00:52:47.590
Like I am, like just to see, you know, to discover.
就像我一样，去看看，去发现。

1228
00:52:47.790 --> 00:52:53.250
Applause to Dave and Rob and everyone editing the Super Fans and putting them together and Claire and Dean.
为戴夫、罗布以及所有剪辑“超级粉丝版”并将其整合在一起的人，还有克莱尔和迪恩鼓掌。

1229
00:52:53.250 --> 00:52:58.490
But, Dave, before we say goodbye to you, we need to talk about something which we can't talk about.
但是，戴夫，在我们和你道别之前，我们需要谈论一件我们不能谈论的事情。

1230
00:52:58.490 --> 00:53:03.750
So I don't know how we're going to talk about it except that we got to go to the set of the paper.
所以我不知道我们该怎么谈，除了我们去了《纸业公司》的片场。

