00:53:04.530 --> 00:53:05.850
You were directing.
你在执导。

1232
00:53:05.850 --> 00:53:06.770
You were directing.
你在执导。

1233
00:53:06.770 --> 00:53:09.110
We can't say anything else, really.
真的，我们不能再说别的了。

1234
00:53:09.590 --> 00:53:12.210
But how fun to see you directing.
但看到你执导真是太有趣了。

1235
00:53:13.250 --> 00:53:17.730
And we can't wait to have you on to talk about the paper for reals.
我们迫不及待想请你来真正聊聊《纸业公司》了。

1236
00:53:18.010 --> 00:53:18.270
Yes.
是的。

1237
00:53:18.410 --> 00:53:19.890
I'm excited to talk about it.
我很期待聊聊它。

1238
00:53:20.470 --> 00:53:21.770
Can't say too much now.
现在不能说太多。

1239
00:53:21.770 --> 00:53:23.510
It was great seeing you guys.
见到你们真好。

1240
00:53:24.130 --> 00:53:25.650
